## Acceptance criteria

- `train.py` exists in the workspace and exports a `VibeTrainModel` class with the `from_config` / `train` interface described above.
- The model architecture implements every layer explicitly in workspace code (attention with GQA, SwiGLU MLP, RMSNorm, Llama3-scaled RoPE) — no importing `LlamaModel` or `LlamaAttention` from transformers.
- FSDP wrapping is applied at the `TransformerBlock` level with `FULL_SHARD`, `MixedPrecision(param_dtype=BF16, reduce_dtype=FP32)`, and `use_orig_params=True`.
- Selective activation checkpointing is applied to attention layers using `use_reentrant=False`.
- AdamW optimizer is configured with `fused=True` (FSDP1) or `foreach=True` (FSDP2).
- Training runs without OOM on {{ num_gpus() }}×{{ gpu_type() }} with local_batch_size=2, seq_len=4096.
{% if acc_checker_path %}
- The accuracy checker at `{{ acc_checker_path }}` passes: `python checker.py --ref /tmp/ref_grads.pt --candidate /tmp/cand_grads.pt` exits 0.
{% endif %}
{% if bench_path %}
- The benchmark at `{{ bench_path }}` reports `tokens_per_sec > 0`.
{% endif %}
- The project is initialized with `uv init`, dependencies added via `uv add`, and scripts run through `uv run`.

